Bluetooth Connection Request & Packet Tracker Application

A full-stack Bluetooth Low Energy (BLE) management and packet inspection suite. It combines a Monolithic Rust Backend (responsible for host controller scanning, GATT connection handshakes, service/characteristic discovery, and WebSocket packet streaming) with a Modular Angular Frontend (strictly partitioned into CoreModule, SharedModule, and lazy-loaded feature modules).

