4. Backend: Monolithic Rust Implementation

The entire backend resides inside backend/src/main.rs as a self-contained monolith. It manages the hardware adapter lifecycle, maintains a thread-safe HashMap of discovered devices, processes incoming HTTP connection requests, and broadcasts packet events over a Tokio broadcast channel.

